---
source: crates/nash-codegen/src/builtin_sharing_tests.rs
expression: "format!(\"--- uplc before\\n{}\\n--- uplc after\\n{}\\n--- result\\n{}\\n--- logs\\n{:?}\",\nnash_plutus::pretty::term(before), nash_plutus::pretty::term(after),\ncandidate.result, candidate.logs)"
---
--- uplc before
[[(force (builtin trace)) (con string "never")]
  (force [[(force (builtin trace)) (con string "argument")] (delay (error))])]
--- uplc after
[(lam builtin_1
  [[builtin_1 (con string "never")]
    (force [[builtin_1 (con string "argument")] (delay (error))])])
  (force (builtin trace))]
--- result
error: ExplicitErrorTerm
--- logs
["argument"]
